sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  title Submit a template from the public web form
  participant U as Author
  participant W as Web App
  participant A as Express API
  participant V as Validation
  participant S as Supabase
  U->>W: Fill /submit form + upload preview/sample
  W->>A: POST /api/submissions (multipart)
  A->>V: validateSubmission(body)
  V-->>A: normalized payload
  A->>S: resolve category and publisher slugs
  S-->>A: taxonomy IDs
  A->>S: submissions.insert(status = pending)
  S-->>A: created submission
  A-->>W: 201 receipt
  W-->>U: Show pending confirmation
  Note over A: Submission rate limit is 5 requests/minute per client.
